  "privacy": {
    "information": "Privacy Information",
    "infoNoServer": "Your records sit in this browser, unencrypted — deleting the site data deletes them. Runaldinho runs no server that keeps a copy. The only things that leave are what you route to a connection, what you send to your AI provider, and the Drive snapshots if you turn cross-device sync on.",
    "infoExtension": "Garmin, Train2Go, WHOOP, Tanita and TrainingPeaks connect through the Kaiord extension, which rides the session you already have open on each site. Your passwords never leave your browser.",
    "infoApiKey": "intervals.icu connects with an API key you paste. It is stored encrypted in this browser and sent only to intervals.icu.",
